// Older history: the chat scrolled up near the top of its newest 200 with
// one flick; the next page loads above without moving the row you read,
// and the list goes past 200 rows (review table "Older history"; rule 2:
// a prepend holds the reading row).
// check: older hold=chat from=grow more=200
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"scrollTo": 20}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "older", "for": 5}
{"scroll": 1000, "steps": 1}
{"wait": 4.5}
